  "userDescription": "Relationship traversal over the modeled Furusato ontology. Use it for connectivity, path, neighbourhood, membership and containment questions across Prefecture, Municipality, Donor, Gift, GiftCategory, Supplier, Donation and the pre-aggregated metric entities. Entity properties carry the same stable IDs as the Lakehouse snapshot, so resolve an ID before traversing a name. Reverse traversal is written with `<-Relationship-`, and there is no direct Supplier-to-Donor edge. The model also mirrors the August observation measure as the modeled time-series property `IncomingDonationAmountYen` on Municipality; the Eventhouse remains the numeric authority for operational observation metrics, and this source is used by the Agent for relationship paths only.",
